	(text "The voltage of SuperCapacitor is 0-3V, and we want to map that \nto the microcontroller's input which is 0-3.3V, so (R_{3}/R_{1}) \nshould be 1.1 to achieve this mapping. Large resistance values \nwere chosen for R_{1} and R_{3} to reduce power consumption."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.146 71.882 0)
